polo (1.0.1+git20261123.b9514ed-1menta2) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Polo session: set org.mate.panel enable-sni-support=true in the polo
    dconf database (Debian's mate-desktop-environment-core ships an
    override that sets it to false, which hides status/tray icons on
